  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management Agreement IDB Suriname Electricty Project 362-010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDB approved on 6 November 2013 a loan to Suriname up to USD 30,000,000 (the IDB Loan)  to be used for the implementation of the Support to Improve Sustainability of the Electricity Service project. B.The Commission entered into an Implementing Agreement with Suriname, as Beneficiary, signed on 10 June 2015, The Commission shall make available a 5 million non-reimbursable contribution from CIF. IDB shall act as the lead finance institution for the implementation for the EU Contribution</narrative>
  </description>
